{
  "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Next-Generation AI LaTeX Editor**\n\n# Don't read or write `.tex`<br>Just work on the <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">\n\nA **new paradigm** for responsible writing and typesetting with AI.\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot shows an AI edit as a typeset before-and-after on the PDF, with Accept, Reject and Comment.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n## 📄 You care about the PDF<br>Not the `.tex` behind it\n\nPapers, theses, books, slides: readers only ever see the typeset page.<br>\n**So the page is where you should work, too.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"Writing LaTeX by hand, then checking LaTeX diffs from AI, and now Papilot: reviewing the PDF.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**No more compiling diffs in your head.**<br>\nA source diff makes you *imagine* the PDF. Papilot *shows* it to you, typeset.\n\n## 👉 Point at the page and say what you want\n\nMark a sentence, an equation or a figure, and write a note.<br>\n**Your agent finds the source. You never open a `.tex` file.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"Papilot with a box around an equation and a highlighted sentence on the PDF, each with a note, both added to the next task.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 Your files stay yours\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Plain files on your machine.** Every change lands in your Git history.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Sync with coauthors through Git.** Pull, push, and let an agent resolve conflicts.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Free and open source.** MIT licensed, for macOS, Linux and Windows.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 Bring the AI agent you already use\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## 📥 Downloads\n\n<!-- BEGIN DOWNLOADS -->\n| System / distribution | Download / package | Install / run |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **macOS** | [Apple Silicon](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Intel](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>DMG / ZIP | Open the DMG and drag Papilot to Applications. |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Windows** | [Installer](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Portable](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>x64 | Run the installer or open the portable executable. |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **Ubuntu / Debian / Linux Mint** | [.deb](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `sudo apt install ./Papilot-*.deb` |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Fedora / Arch / openSUSE** | [AppImage](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `chmod +x Papilot-*.AppImage`<br>`./Papilot-*.AppImage` |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **NixOS** | [Nix flake](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) | [Add to your `flake.nix`](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) |\n| **macOS / Linux / Windows (CLI)** | [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot) | `npm install -g papilot` |\n\nLinux packages are x86_64 and tested on Ubuntu 22.04. See [desktop setup](desktop/README.md#build-and-run) for dependencies and AppImage/FUSE help.\n\nThe npm package opens the browser interface and requires Node.js 22.22+. Nix requires flakes; see [Nix setup](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake).\n<!-- END DOWNLOADS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 Get started\n\n1. **Install.** [Download the app](#downloads) for macOS, Linux or Windows, or run `npm install -g papilot` (Node.js 22.22+). You also need Git and TeX Live or MacTeX.\n2. **Open your project.** Choose the folder with your `.tex` files. Papilot builds the PDF.\n3. **Pick an agent.** Use the CLI login or API key you already have, then mark up the page.\n\nWant a sample first? Run `papilot demo`. Details are in the [guide](docs/guide.md#install-and-run).\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 Community\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Found a bug or missing a feature?** [Open an issue](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose), even a rough one.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Have a question or an idea?** [Start a discussion](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions).\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Become a contributor.** Pull requests are very welcome, including ones written with AI agents. Start with the [contributing guide](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Thanks to our friends at <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Nästa generations AI-drivna LaTeX-redigerare**\n\n# Läs eller skriv inte `.tex`<br>Arbeta direkt i <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">\n\nEtt **nytt paradigm** för ansvarsfullt skrivande och typsättning med AI.\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot visar en AI-redigering som typsatt före-och-efter direkt i PDF:en, med Acceptera, Avvisa och Kommentera.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n## 📄 Du bryr dig om PDF:en<br>Inte om `.tex`-koden bakom den\n\nArtiklar, avhandlingar, böcker, presentationer: läsarna ser bara den typsatta sidan.<br>\n**Därför är det också på sidan du bör arbeta.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"Att skriva LaTeX för hand, sedan kontrollera LaTeX-diffar från AI, och nu Papilot: granskning av PDF:en.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**Sluta kompilera diffar i huvudet.**<br>\nEn källkodsdiff tvingar dig att *föreställa dig* PDF:en. Papilot *visar* den för dig, färdigtypsatt.\n\n## 👉 Peka på sidan och säg vad du vill ha\n\nMarkera en mening, en ekvation eller en figur och skriv en anteckning.<br>\n**Din agent hittar källkoden. Du behöver aldrig öppna en `.tex`-fil.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"Papilot med en ruta runt en ekvation och en markerad mening i PDF:en, var och en med en anteckning, båda tillagda i nästa uppgift.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 Dina filer förblir dina\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Vanliga filer på din dator.** Varje ändring hamnar i din Git-historik.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Synkronisera med medförfattare via Git.** Hämta, skicka och låt en agent lösa konflikter.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Fri och öppen källkod.** MIT-licensierad, för macOS, Linux och Windows.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 Använd den AI-agent du redan har\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## 📥 Nedladdningar\n\n<!-- BEGIN DOWNLOADS -->\n| System / distribution | Nedladdning / paket | Installera / starta |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **macOS** | [Apple Silicon](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Intel](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>DMG / ZIP | Öppna DMG-filen och dra Papilot till Program. |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Windows** | [Installationsprogram](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Portabel version](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>x64 | Kör installationsprogrammet eller öppna den portabla versionen direkt. |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **Ubuntu / Debian / Linux Mint** | [.deb](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `sudo apt install ./Papilot-*.deb` |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Fedora / Arch / openSUSE** | [AppImage](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `chmod +x Papilot-*.AppImage`<br>`./Papilot-*.AppImage` |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **NixOS** | [Nix flake](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) | [Lägg till i din `flake.nix`](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) |\n| **macOS / Linux / Windows (CLI)** | [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot) | `npm install -g papilot` |\n\nLinux-paketen är för x86_64 och har testats på Ubuntu 22.04. Se [skrivbordsguiden](desktop/README.md#build-and-run) för beroenden och hjälp med AppImage/FUSE.\n\nnpm-paketet öppnar webbläsargränssnittet och kräver Node.js 22.22+. Nix kräver att flakes är aktiverade; se [Nix-guiden](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake).\n<!-- END DOWNLOADS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 Kom igång\n\n1. **Installera.** [Ladda ner appen](#downloads) för macOS, Linux eller Windows, eller kör `npm install -g papilot` (Node.js 22.22+). Du behöver även Git samt TeX Live eller MacTeX.\n2. **Öppna ditt projekt.** Välj mappen med dina `.tex`-filer. Papilot bygger PDF:en.\n3. **Välj en agent.** Använd den CLI-inloggning eller API-nyckel du redan har och markera sedan direkt på sidan.\n\nVill du prova ett exempel först? Kör `papilot demo`. Mer information finns i [guiden](docs/guide.md#install-and-run).\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 Gemenskap\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Hittat en bugg eller saknar du en funktion?** [Skapa ett ärende](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose), även ett enkelt utkast räcker.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Har du en fråga eller en idé?** [Starta en diskussion](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions).\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Bli en bidragsgivare.** Pull-förfrågningar är varmt välkomna, även sådana som skrivits med AI-agenter. Börja med [riktlinjerna för bidrag](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Tack till våra vänner på <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n"
